      "side": 1,
      "message": "This patch disables trapping of access to MAPM0_EL1/MPAM1_EL1 and MPAMIDR_EL1 from EL1 to EL2. This is a bare minimum of changes required to enable MPAM support (note that by default MPAM will be disabled when booting at EL2).\nActual \u0027sample\u0027 implementation of MPAM module can be found at:\nhttps://gitlab.arm.com/linux-arm/linux-power/-/merge_requests/1",
      "revId": "e6f7dfcdb13a1a80f3f918d8bdc4dec558b8f458",
